{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想為手機換上與眾不同的背景，又不想與他人重複？Skywall Pro 主打由團隊親手製作的原創桌布，並針對你的裝置度身設計，適合重視桌面質感的使用者。現時原價 US $0.99，限時免費於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>手繪原創桌布每日更新</h2>\n<p>應用程式內收錄數百款由 Skywall 團隊親自設計的原創桌布，並針對不同裝置尺寸調整，其他應用程式難以找到相同背景。你亦可自行上傳相片，免費且安全地儲存於雲端，數量不限。「每日桌布」專區每天更新，展示全新作品與精選內容。介面以 Material 風格設計，瀏覽順暢，開啟即可欣賞視覺細節；團隊持續創作，每天為你帶來高品質新素材。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-390-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-391-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-392-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-393-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-394-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-395-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Skywall Pro – HD+ Wallpapers</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T02:06:39.111432+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":353,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}